# The node base image every Sea N Shore image starts from (Dockerfile ARG NODE_BASE_IMAGE): Docker's official
# node:22-bookworm-slim for linux/amd64 (the ECS tasks run X86_64), pinned by manifest digest (node 22.23.3,
# published 2026-10-06). Amazon ECR Public mirrors the official image with the same digest. The deploy builds use
# our own copy in the private ECR repository NODE_BASE_REPOSITORY (scripts/aws/node-base-image.sh); PR CI pulls
# the same digest from ECR Public or Google's mirror. To move to a newer node image, change NODE_BASE_DIGEST here
# and the matching default in the Dockerfile; the next deploy copies it.
NODE_BASE_TAG=22-bookworm-slim
NODE_BASE_DIGEST=sha256:efd0ab5780c2d9ab1f0f869571a00d5edb17793bff4cce4a2792e3eb0ffc7562
NODE_BASE_REPOSITORY=sea-n-shore-base/node
